{"id":"en_my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18","title":"My Billionaire Great-Grandfather is 18","titleEn":"My Billionaire Great-Grandfather is 18","description":"A legendary business titan and war hero died eighty years ago while protecting his daughter. He wakes to find himself in the body of an eighteen-year-old widely regarded as a humiliated loser. His daughter, now eighty, calls him Father, an icy CEO kneels before him, and a top star throws herself at him. He takes down a scumbag with a single punch and fells a family traitor with one kick, setting out to reclaim his former glory. Viewers can follow the series and its episodes on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Rebirth","Return of the King","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du66c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du66c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du66c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7du66c/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-billionaire-great-grandfather-is-18_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id